# GitHub asks the owner named here to review any pull request touching
# these paths, and with "Require review from Code Owners" on the default
# branch the merge waits for that approval. With "code_owners": true
# under merge, the Merger waits for it too.
#
# .agent-forge/ gives each App its identity and decides which reviewer
# may approve; tools/host/ holds the settings every agent session runs
# under and the crontabs installed unattended. An agent may propose a
# change to them, but only the owner's review lets it merge. This file
# is listed too, so a pull request can't remove the guard as it goes.
/.agent-forge/ @example-owner
/tools/host/ @example-owner
/.github/CODEOWNERS @example-owner
